  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEg">II Eg</ref> 2.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa circan hæbbe þe legerstow on [ne] sy, do he of þam nigoðan dæle his preoste þæt þæt he wille.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone has a church to which there is no graveyard attached, he shall pay what he will to his priest out of the next tenth part.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf hwa cyrican habbe, þe legerstow on ne sie, ðonne do he of þam nigan dælum his preoste þæt þæt he wille.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
